            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="d306-05" n="5" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76ve06/d306-05"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following changes have been made to the online version of <ref
                        target="frus:frus1969-76ve06">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations of the United States</hi>,
                        1969–1976, Volume E–6, Documents on Africa, 1973–1976</ref>. </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. Documents <ref target="#d293">293</ref> and <ref
                                target="#d294">294</ref>. </hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The text of Documents 293 and 294 were transposed in the original,
                        appearing under the wrong heading. The document text for each was put under
                        the correct heading.</item>
                    <item>Date of Correction: July 16, 2020</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
